      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. u mentioned privacy and ethics in point 5 but it feels a bit vague. like, what are the actual downsides people are worried about? is it actually a big deal or is it mostly just people being paranoid about privacy? i need to know if i should even bother including a section on civil liberties in my report.",
